Project OACS memory, when already configured, may supply decisions and previous
verification. Check current sources before reusing version-sensitive claims.
OACS is not required to install this skill or query its packs. No automatic OACS
adapter is implemented in the toolkit. After configuration source edits, use
`init` with the required profile: status does not hash every BSL/XML file.
